Z||000014||Rodney||03-12-2000||10:19 PM||||Check or money order to:<P>Rodney Dickman<BR>10227 Caddy Lane<BR>Caledonia, WI  53108<P>$45 for both motors (Gears, bumpers, grease and bolts/nuts). Includes shipping. With the new brush assemblies it is $89 for both and that includes shipping.<P>Thanks,<BR>Rodney<BR> <A HREF="http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/</A> <P>They are not on my page yet.<BR>||||reg||1
